\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Baseline-invariant absolute spot loss. Comparison of the absolute WSPR spot loss during storms between the training (18-month) and held-out (3-month) periods for all three bands. On 40\,m, the absolute loss is identical ($\SI {-18300}{spots/h}$, ratio = 1.00) despite $\SI {+38}{\percent }$ network growth, confirming a fixed population of vulnerable propagation paths.}}{12}{figure.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:baseline}{{5}{12}{Baseline-invariant absolute spot loss. Comparison of the absolute WSPR spot loss during storms between the training (18-month) and held-out (3-month) periods for all three bands. On 40\,m, the absolute loss is identical ($\SI {-18300}{spots/h}$, ratio = 1.00) despite $\SI {+38}{\percent }$ network growth, confirming a fixed population of vulnerable propagation paths}{figure.caption.13}{}}
